                    coach_default:          `Decision logged.`,
                    coach_r1_product:       `<strong>That's the honest read.</strong> You trail a full energy class <em>and</em> 71% of your power is grid — the binding constraint is product performance and manufacturing emissions together, which is exactly the product/process pairing Čater's nexus is built on. Diagnose both and you can design a bet that pays on both.`,
                    coach_r1_brand:         `<strong>“Just a greener story” is the compliance mindset in disguise.</strong> Marketing can't paint over an energy label a class behind the leaders or a factory on 71% grid power. The gap is real and physical — a campaign won't move the EU label or the Scope-2 number the carbon-border rule will price.`,
                    coach_r1_emissions:     `<strong>Fixing the factory is half the diagnosis.</strong> Cutting Scope-2 is genuinely valuable — but if the customer-facing energy label doesn't move, your at-risk SKUs still fail the threshold and marketing still has nothing to sell. The customer doesn't see your kilowatt-hours.`,
                    coach_r1_none:          `<strong>“Bad luck, portfolio's healthy” is how you sleepwalk off the cliff.</strong> 38% of SKUs (€83M) fail the new thresholds in 24 months and become unsellable in the EU. That isn't bad luck — it's a dated countdown. Underestimate it now and you'll be diagnosing by lost tender.`,
                    coach_r1_skuignore:     `<strong>Hoping the rules soften is not a plan.</strong> The Ecodesign tightening is confirmed with a 24-month clock. Without a SKU-by-SKU audit you can't tell market-access capex from nice-to-have — and €83M of revenue is riding on knowing which is which.`,
                    coach_r1_channel:       `<strong>You've barely looked at the 46%.</strong> Both white-label partners have signalled they'll dual-source within 18 months without a credible green strategy — that's €41M of further volume. Perfecting the own brand while the channel walks is optimising 54% and risking 46%.`,
                    coach_r2_selective:     `<strong>Selective proactivity is the disciplined stance.</strong> Lead green where you can defend it and merely comply elsewhere — you concentrate the fixed €9.0M where it builds a real, rare edge instead of spreading it thin chasing leadership on every front. That's a strategy, not a slogan.`,
